{"seq":1,"slug":"data-driven-decision-framework","title":"数据驱动决策框架","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-systems/quantified-self/improvement-feedback-loop/data-driven-decision-framework","wordCount":1726,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"数据驱动决策框架\">数据驱动决策框架</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>收集数据、展示数据只是量化自我的前半程——真正的价值在于将数据转化为更好的个人决策。大多数量化自我实践者的瓶颈不是数据不足，而是缺乏一个系统性的决策框架将洞察转化为行动。本文引入「假设→实验→验证」循环和贝叶斯思维两个核心工具，帮助你从被动的数据观察者升级为主动的生活实验科学家。核心理念是：对自己的每一个生活改变，都像对待一个科学实验一样——有明确的假设、可量化的预期、和严格的验证标准。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-假设-实验-验证循环\">核心概念：假设-实验-验证循环</h2><h3 id=\"个人科学方法论\">个人科学方法论</h3><p>将科学方法应用到个人生活改善中，形成闭环的决策系统：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[&quot;Observe pattern in data&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;Form hypothesis&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;Design experiment&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;Execute for N days&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E[&quot;Collect outcome data&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; F[&quot;Analyze results&quot;]&#10;    F --&gt; G{&quot;Hypothesis confirmed?&quot;}&#10;    G --&gt;|Yes| H[&quot;Adopt as new default&quot;]&#10;    G --&gt;|No| I[&quot;Refine hypothesis&quot;]&#10;    I --&gt; B&#10;    G --&gt;|Inconclusive| J[&quot;Extend experiment period&quot;]&#10;    J --&gt; D\">graph TD\n    A[\"Observe pattern in data\"] --&gt; B[\"Form hypothesis\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"Design experiment\"]\n    C --&gt; D[\"Execute for N days\"]\n    D --&gt; E[\"Collect outcome data\"]\n    E --&gt; F[\"Analyze results\"]\n    F --&gt; G{\"Hypothesis confirmed?\"}\n    G --&gt;|Yes| H[\"Adopt as new default\"]\n    G --&gt;|No| I[\"Refine hypothesis\"]\n    I --&gt; B\n    G --&gt;|Inconclusive| J[\"Extend experiment period\"]\n    J --&gt; D</pre><p><strong>与传统「试一试」的区别</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>随意尝试</th>\n<th>个人科学方法</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>假设</td>\n<td>隐含的、模糊的</td>\n<td>明确写下、可证伪</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>变量控制</td>\n<td>同时改多个东西</td>\n<td>一次只改一个变量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>时长</td>\n<td>感觉够了就停</td>\n<td>预定义最小观察期</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>成功标准</td>\n<td>主观「感觉好了」</td>\n<td>量化指标 + 统计显著性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>记录</td>\n<td>没有或事后重建</td>\n<td>实时追踪、保留原始数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>结论</td>\n<td>情绪化（有效/无效）</td>\n<td>量化效果大小 + 置信度</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"假设的正确写法\">假设的正确写法</h3><p>一个好的个人假设需要满足 SMART-F 标准：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"S - Specific（具体）：明确哪个变量&#10;M - Measurable（可测量）：有量化的成功指标&#10;A - Achievable（可执行）：在日常生活中能做到&#10;R - Relevant（相关）：连接到你关心的最终目标&#10;T - Time-bound（有时限）：明确实验周期&#10;F - Falsifiable（可证伪）：能被数据推翻&#10;&#10;好假设示例：&#10;&quot;在接下来的14天中，如果我将最后一餐时间从21:00提前到19:00，&#10;我的深睡时长将从基线的72分钟提升至少10%（即≥79分钟），&#10;以Oura Ring记录的每晚深睡分钟数为准。&quot;&#10;&#10;坏假设示例：&#10;&quot;早点吃晚饭应该对睡眠有帮助。&quot;&#10;（不具体、不可测量、无时限、不可证伪）\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>S - Specific（具体）：明确哪个变量</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>M - Measurable（可测量）：有量化的成功指标</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>A - Achievable（可执行）：在日常生活中能做到</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>R - Relevant（相关）：连接到你关心的最终目标</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>T - Time-bound（有时限）：明确实验周期</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>F - Falsifiable（可证伪）：能被数据推翻</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>好假设示例：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"在接下来的14天中，如果我将最后一餐时间从21:00提前到19:00，</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>我的深睡时长将从基线的72分钟提升至少10%（即≥79分钟），</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>以Oura Ring记录的每晚深睡分钟数为准。\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>坏假设示例：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"早点吃晚饭应该对睡眠有帮助。\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>（不具体、不可测量、无时限、不可证伪）</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"效果量与实际意义\">效果量与实际意义</h3><p>统计显著性 ≠ 实际意义。对于个人实验，关注效果量（Effect Size）比 p 值更重要：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>效果量 (Cohen&#39;s d)</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>个人实验中的判断</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>&lt; 0.2</td>\n<td>微小效果</td>\n<td>可能不值得维持这个改变</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>0.2 - 0.5</td>\n<td>小效果</td>\n<td>有帮助但不显著，考虑成本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>0.5 - 0.8</td>\n<td>中等效果</td>\n<td>值得采纳的改善</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&gt; 0.8</td>\n<td>大效果</td>\n<td>明确有价值，优先采纳</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"def calculate_effect_size(baseline_data, experiment_data):&#10;    &quot;&quot;&quot;计算Cohen&#39;s d效果量&quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;    import numpy as np&#10;&#10;    mean_diff = np.mean(experiment_data) - np.mean(baseline_data)&#10;    pooled_std = np.sqrt(&#10;        (np.std(baseline_data)**2 + np.std(experiment_data)**2) / 2&#10;    )&#10;&#10;    cohens_d = mean_diff / pooled_std&#10;&#10;    interpretation = (&#10;        &quot;negligible&quot; if abs(cohens_d) &lt; 0.2 else&#10;        &quot;small&quot; if abs(cohens_d) &lt; 0.5 else&#10;        &quot;medium&quot; if abs(cohens_d) &lt; 0.8 else&#10;        &quot;large&quot;&#10;    )&#10;&#10;    return {&#10;        &#39;cohens_d&#39;: round(cohens_d, 3),&#10;        &#39;interpretation&#39;: interpretation,&#10;        &#39;mean_change&#39;: round(mean_diff, 2),&#10;        &#39;percent_change&#39;: round(mean_diff / np.mean(baseline_data) * 100, 1)&#10;    }\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> calculate_effect_size</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(baseline_data, experiment_data):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"\"\"计算Cohen's d效果量\"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> numpy </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    mean_diff </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.mean(experiment_data) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.mean(baseline_data)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    pooled_std </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.sqrt(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        (np.std(baseline_data)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">**</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> +</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.std(experiment_data)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">**</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    cohens_d </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> mean_diff </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pooled_std</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    interpretation </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"negligible\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> if</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> abs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(cohens_d) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> else</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"small\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> if</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> abs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(cohens_d) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.5</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> else</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"medium\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> if</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> abs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(cohens_d) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.8</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> else</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"large\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        'cohens_d'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">round</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(cohens_d, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        'interpretation'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: interpretation,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        'mean_change'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">round</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(mean_diff, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        'percent_change'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">round</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(mean_diff </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.mean(baseline_data) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"实战指南-贝叶斯思维在个人决策中的应用\">实战指南：贝叶斯思维在个人决策中的应用</h2><h3 id=\"从频率派到贝叶斯视角\">从频率派到贝叶斯视角</h3><p>传统的「p &lt; 0.05 就显著」在个人实验中几乎不适用——样本量太小（通常 7-30 天）、多次比较问题严重。贝叶斯方法更适合个人决策，因为它：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>自然地整合先验知识（你对这个干预的预期）</li>\n<li>给出「效果存在」的概率（而非「假设效果不存在时的数据概率」）</li>\n<li>可以随着数据积累持续更新信念</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"个人贝叶斯更新模型\">个人贝叶斯更新模型</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import numpy as np&#10;from scipy import stats&#10;&#10;def bayesian_personal_experiment(prior_belief, observed_data, baseline_data):&#10;    &quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;    贝叶斯个人实验分析&#10;&#10;    参数:&#10;    - prior_belief: 你认为干预有效的先验概率 (0-1)&#10;    - observed_data: 实验期间的数据&#10;    - baseline_data: 基线期间的数据&#10;    &quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;    # 计算似然比（简化的正态模型）&#10;    effect = np.mean(observed_data) - np.mean(baseline_data)&#10;    se = np.sqrt(np.var(baseline_data)/len(baseline_data) +&#10;                 np.var(observed_data)/len(observed_data))&#10;&#10;    # H1: 效果存在（假设效果 ~ N(effect, se)）&#10;    # H0: 效果为零&#10;    likelihood_ratio = stats.norm.pdf(effect, loc=effect, scale=se) / \\&#10;                       stats.norm.pdf(effect, loc=0, scale=se)&#10;&#10;    # 贝叶斯更新&#10;    prior_odds = prior_belief / (1 - prior_belief)&#10;    posterior_odds = prior_odds * likelihood_ratio&#10;    posterior_prob = posterior_odds / (1 + posterior_odds)&#10;&#10;    return {&#10;        &#39;prior_belief&#39;: f&quot;{prior_belief*100:.0f}%&quot;,&#10;        &#39;posterior_belief&#39;: f&quot;{posterior_prob*100:.1f}%&quot;,&#10;        &#39;belief_change&#39;: f&quot;+{(posterior_prob - prior_belief)*100:.1f}%&quot;,&#10;        &#39;effect_estimate&#39;: f&quot;{effect:.2f}&quot;,&#10;        &#39;confidence_interval&#39;: f&quot;[{effect-1.96*se:.2f}, {effect+1.96*se:.2f}]&quot;,&#10;        &#39;recommendation&#39;: &#39;adopt&#39; if posterior_prob &gt; 0.75 else&#10;                         &#39;continue testing&#39; if posterior_prob &gt; 0.5 else&#10;                         &#39;likely ineffective&#39;&#10;    }\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> numpy </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> scipy </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> stats</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> bayesian_personal_experiment</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(prior_belief, observed_data, baseline_data):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    贝叶斯个人实验分析</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    参数:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    - prior_belief: 你认为干预有效的先验概率 (0-1)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    - observed_data: 实验期间的数据</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    - baseline_data: 基线期间的数据</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # 计算似然比（简化的正态模型）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    effect </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.mean(observed_data) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.mean(baseline_data)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    se </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.sqrt(np.var(baseline_data)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">len</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(baseline_data) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                 np.var(observed_data)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">len</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(observed_data))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # H1: 效果存在（假设效果 ~ N(effect, se)）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # H0: 效果为零</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    likelihood_ratio </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> stats.norm.pdf(effect, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">loc</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">effect, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">scale</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">se) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                       stats.norm.pdf(effect, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">loc</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">scale</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">se)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # 贝叶斯更新</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    prior_odds </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> prior_belief </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> prior_belief)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    posterior_odds </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> prior_odds </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> likelihood_ratio</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    posterior_prob </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> posterior_odds </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> +</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> posterior_odds)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        'prior_belief'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">prior_belief</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:.0f</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">%\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        'posterior_belief'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">posterior_prob</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:.1f</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">%\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        'belief_change'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(posterior_prob </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> prior_belief)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:.1f</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">%\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        'effect_estimate'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">effect</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:.2f</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        'confidence_interval'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">effect</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1.96</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">se</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:.2f</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">effect</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1.96</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">se</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:.2f</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">]\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        'recommendation'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'adopt'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> posterior_prob </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.75</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> else</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">                         'continue testing'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> posterior_prob </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.5</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> else</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">                         'likely ineffective'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"先验知识的来源\">先验知识的来源</h3><p>贝叶斯方法的优势在于可以利用已有知识设置合理的先验：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>先验来源</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n<th>合理的先验概率</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>强科学证据</td>\n<td>「运动改善睡眠」</td>\n<td>0.8-0.9</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>弱/混合证据</td>\n<td>「镁补充改善深睡」</td>\n<td>0.4-0.6</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>个人前期经验</td>\n<td>「我之前试过有效」</td>\n<td>0.6-0.7</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>纯探索性</td>\n<td>「冷水淋浴改善精力」</td>\n<td>0.3-0.5</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>违背直觉</td>\n<td>「减少运动量反而改善恢复」</td>\n<td>0.2-0.3</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"决策阈值设定\">决策阈值设定</h3><p>在贝叶斯框架下，个人决策使用「后验概率阈值」：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"后验概率 &gt; 90% → 高度确信，采纳为新默认&#10;后验概率 75-90% → 较确信，采纳并继续监控&#10;后验概率 50-75% → 不确定，延长实验或增加数据&#10;后验概率 25-50% → 可能无效，考虑放弃&#10;后验概率 &lt; 25% → 高度确信无效，停止实验\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>后验概率 > 90% → 高度确信，采纳为新默认</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>后验概率 75-90% → 较确信，采纳并继续监控</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>后验概率 50-75% → 不确定，延长实验或增加数据</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>后验概率 25-50% → 可能无效，考虑放弃</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>后验概率 &#x3C; 25% → 高度确信无效，停止实验</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"最佳实践-决策质量的持续提升\">最佳实践：决策质量的持续提升</h2><h3 id=\"决策日志系统\">决策日志系统</h3><p>建立一个记录所有重要个人决策的系统，定期回顾校准：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"decision_log_template = {&#10;    &quot;date&quot;: &quot;2026-01-15&quot;,&#10;    &quot;decision&quot;: &quot;将每日冥想从5分钟增加到15分钟&quot;,&#10;    &quot;hypothesis&quot;: &quot;更长的冥想时间将使日间压力评分降低≥15%&quot;,&#10;    &quot;prior_confidence&quot;: 0.6,&#10;    &quot;evidence_considered&quot;: [&#10;        &quot;研究显示10-20分钟对HRV改善更明显&quot;,&#10;        &quot;5分钟版本已有轻微效果(约8%改善)&quot;&#10;    ],&#10;    &quot;experiment_design&quot;: {&#10;        &quot;duration_days&quot;: 21,&#10;        &quot;control_metric&quot;: &quot;Garmin日间压力平均分&quot;,&#10;        &quot;baseline_value&quot;: 42,&#10;        &quot;success_threshold&quot;: &quot;≤35.7 (降低15%)&quot;&#10;    },&#10;    &quot;outcome&quot;: None,  # 实验完成后填写&#10;    &quot;post_mortem&quot;: None  # 回顾时填写&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">decision_log_template </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"date\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-01-15\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"decision\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"将每日冥想从5分钟增加到15分钟\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"hypothesis\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"更长的冥想时间将使日间压力评分降低≥15%\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"prior_confidence\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.6</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"evidence_considered\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"研究显示10-20分钟对HRV改善更明显\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"5分钟版本已有轻微效果(约8%改善)\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"experiment_design\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"duration_days\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">21</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"control_metric\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Garmin日间压力平均分\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"baseline_value\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">42</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"success_threshold\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"≤35.7 (降低15%)\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"outcome\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">None</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 实验完成后填写</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"post_mortem\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">None</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  # 回顾时填写</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"校准练习\">校准练习</h3><p>大多数人对自己预测的准确度过度自信。定期做校准检查：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>你的预测置信度</th>\n<th>实际命中率应该是</th>\n<th>如果实际是...</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>60%</td>\n<td>60%</td>\n<td>&gt;75% → 你过度保守</td>\n<td>可以更果断决策</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>80%</td>\n<td>80%</td>\n<td>&lt;60% → 你过度自信</td>\n<td>需要更多数据再决定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>90%</td>\n<td>90%</td>\n<td>&lt;75% → 严重过度自信</td>\n<td>系统性校准问题</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>校准方法</strong>：每月回顾上月的 10-20 个预测，统计命中率。如果你「80% 确信」的事情只有 60% 成真，说明你需要在未来将 80% 调低到 60%。</p>\n<h3 id=\"决策组合管理\">决策组合管理</h3><p>不是每个决策都需要完美——关键是在多个决策的组合层面最优化：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[&quot;Decision Portfolio&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;High-confidence bets&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; C[&quot;Exploratory experiments&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; D[&quot;Maintenance defaults&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; E[&quot;70%: Proven interventions&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; F[&quot;20%: Novel hypotheses&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; G[&quot;10%: Monitoring existing habits&quot;]\">graph LR\n    A[\"Decision Portfolio\"] --&gt; B[\"High-confidence bets\"]\n    A --&gt; C[\"Exploratory experiments\"]\n    A --&gt; D[\"Maintenance defaults\"]\n    B --&gt; E[\"70%: Proven interventions\"]\n    C --&gt; F[\"20%: Novel hypotheses\"]\n    D --&gt; G[\"10%: Monitoring existing habits\"]</pre><p><strong>组合策略</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>70% 确定性投注</strong>：已经验证有效的干预（持续维持）</li>\n<li><strong>20% 探索性实验</strong>：新假设的测试（保持好奇心）</li>\n<li><strong>10% 维护性监控</strong>：确认已有习惯没有退化</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"避免常见的决策陷阱\">避免常见的决策陷阱</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>陷阱</th>\n<th>表现</th>\n<th>数据化解法</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>确认偏差</td>\n<td>只看支持假设的数据</td>\n<td>预注册假设 + 盲法分析</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>近因偏差</td>\n<td>过度依赖最近的经验</td>\n<td>使用30天+的基线数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>安慰剂效应</td>\n<td>新干预的前几天总是「有效」</td>\n<td>等待2周以上再判断</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>沉没成本</td>\n<td>已经投入很多不愿放弃</td>\n<td>设置预定义的停止规则</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多重比较</td>\n<td>同时测试5个假设总有一个「显著」</td>\n<td>一次只测一个变量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>回归均值</td>\n<td>极端值后自然回归被误认为干预效果</td>\n<td>用长期趋势而非单点对比</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"工具与生态\">工具与生态</h2><h3 id=\"个人实验管理工具\">个人实验管理工具</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>工具</th>\n<th>定位</th>\n<th>核心功能</th>\n<th>价格</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>QS Access (iOS)</td>\n<td>Apple Health 分析</td>\n<td>导出+简单统计</td>\n<td>免费</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Quantified Self Wiki</td>\n<td>社区知识库</td>\n<td>实验模板、案例分享</td>\n<td>免费</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Exist.io</td>\n<td>自动关联发现</td>\n<td>「你在X的日子Y更好」</td>\n<td>$6/月</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Jupyter Notebook</td>\n<td>深度分析</td>\n<td>完全自定义统计</td>\n<td>免费</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Notion 模板</td>\n<td>实验记录管理</td>\n<td>结构化决策日志</td>\n<td>免费/$10</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"统计分析工具\">统计分析工具</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>分析需求</th>\n<th>推荐工具</th>\n<th>方法</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>简单前后对比</td>\n<td>Excel/Sheets</td>\n<td>配对 t 检验、效果量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>时间序列中断分析</td>\n<td>Python (causalimpact)</td>\n<td>合成控制法</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>贝叶斯更新</td>\n<td>Python (pymc3/arviz)</td>\n<td>MCMC 采样</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可视化探索</td>\n<td>Grafana annotations</td>\n<td>干预前后可视对比</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>N-of-1 试验</td>\n<td>R (SingleCaseES)</td>\n<td>专为个案设计的统计方法</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"决策框架模板\">决策框架模板</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"markdown\" data-code=\"## 个人实验模板&#10;&#10;### 1. 背景&#10;&#10;- 观察到的问题/模式：&#10;- 相关数据支持：&#10;&#10;### 2. 假设&#10;&#10;- 具体假设声明：&#10;- 先验置信度：\\_\\_\\_%&#10;- 先验来源：&#10;&#10;### 3. 实验设计&#10;&#10;- 干预内容：&#10;- 实验期：\\_\\_\\_天（最少14天）&#10;- 基线期：\\_\\_\\_天（最少7天）&#10;- 主要指标：&#10;- 成功阈值：&#10;- 停止规则（安全边界）：&#10;&#10;### 4. 执行记录&#10;&#10;- 开始日期：&#10;- 依从性记录：&#10;- 意外事件：&#10;&#10;### 5. 结果分析&#10;&#10;- 效果量 (Cohen&#39;s d)：&#10;- 后验概率：&#10;- 实际 vs 预期：&#10;&#10;### 6. 决策&#10;&#10;- [ ] 采纳 [ ] 继续测试 [ ] 放弃&#10;- 后续行动：\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">## 个人实验模板</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">### 1. 背景</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 观察到的问题/模式：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 相关数据支持：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">### 2. 假设</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 具体假设声明：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 先验置信度：</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\_\\_\\_</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">%</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 先验来源：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">### 3. 实验设计</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 干预内容：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 实验期：</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\_\\_\\_</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">天（最少14天）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 基线期：</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\_\\_\\_</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">天（最少7天）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 主要指标：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 成功阈值：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 停止规则（安全边界）：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">### 4. 执行记录</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 开始日期：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 依从性记录：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 意外事件：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">### 5. 结果分析</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 效果量 (Cohen's d)：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 后验概率：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 实际 vs 预期：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">### 6. 决策</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [ ] 采纳 [ ] 继续测试 [ ] 放弃</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 后续行动：</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"总结\">总结</h2><p>数据驱动决策框架的核心是将模糊的生活改善意图转化为严格的个人科学实验。三个关键心智转变：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>从「试一试」到「测一测」</strong>：每次生活改变都有明确的假设、量化的预期和预定义的评判标准。不再依赖「感觉有没有用」的模糊判断</li>\n<li><strong>从「对或错」到「可能性多大」</strong>：贝叶斯思维将决策从二元判断转变为连续的信念更新——每个实验都让你对某个假设的信心精确地增加或减少</li>\n<li><strong>从「单次决策」到「决策系统」</strong>：通过决策日志和校准练习，持续改善决策质量——不是追求每次都做对，而是让整体命中率持续提升</li>\n</ol>\n<p>最终目标是将这个框架内化为一种思维习惯：面对任何生活改变的念头时，自然而然地问出「假设是什么？怎么测量？多久能知道结果？」——这就是量化自我的最高形态：不只是量化数据，而是量化决策本身的质量。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"数据驱动决策框架","id":"数据驱动决策框架"},{"level":2,"text":"概述","id":"概述"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：假设-实验-验证循环","id":"核心概念-假设-实验-验证循环"},{"level":3,"text":"个人科学方法论","id":"个人科学方法论"},{"level":3,"text":"假设的正确写法","id":"假设的正确写法"},{"level":3,"text":"效果量与实际意义","id":"效果量与实际意义"},{"level":2,"text":"实战指南：贝叶斯思维在个人决策中的应用","id":"实战指南-贝叶斯思维在个人决策中的应用"},{"level":3,"text":"从频率派到贝叶斯视角","id":"从频率派到贝叶斯视角"},{"level":3,"text":"个人贝叶斯更新模型","id":"个人贝叶斯更新模型"},{"level":3,"text":"先验知识的来源","id":"先验知识的来源"},{"level":3,"text":"决策阈值设定","id":"决策阈值设定"},{"level":2,"text":"最佳实践：决策质量的持续提升","id":"最佳实践-决策质量的持续提升"},{"level":3,"text":"决策日志系统","id":"决策日志系统"},{"level":3,"text":"校准练习","id":"校准练习"},{"level":3,"text":"决策组合管理","id":"决策组合管理"},{"level":3,"text":"避免常见的决策陷阱","id":"避免常见的决策陷阱"},{"level":2,"text":"工具与生态","id":"工具与生态"},{"level":3,"text":"个人实验管理工具","id":"个人实验管理工具"},{"level":3,"text":"统计分析工具","id":"统计分析工具"},{"level":3,"text":"决策框架模板","id":"决策框架模板"},{"level":2,"text":"总结","id":"总结"}],"prev":{"title":"可视化最佳实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-systems/quantified-self/personal-dashboard/visualization-best-practices"},"next":{"title":"实验设计与验证","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-systems/quantified-self/improvement-feedback-loop/experiment-design-and-validation"}}